WEBVTT

00:05.300 --> 00:08.502
Saheli — aapki business saheli. Bas boliye.

00:08.902 --> 00:12.786
Sonali bas apni bhasha mein bolti hai…

00:13.186 --> 00:16.994
Saheli samajhti hai — aur ek baar mein ek hi sawaal poochhti hai

00:17.394 --> 00:20.233
Daam, WhatsApp, UPI — jaise wo bole, waise

00:20.633 --> 00:23.695
Business profile tayyar. Kuch galat ho to “Badlo”

00:24.095 --> 00:29.233
Photos se catalogue — Claude Vision products pehchaanta hai

00:29.633 --> 00:34.356
GoDaddy par asli naam aur saal ka daam

00:34.756 --> 00:40.088
Har kharcha pehle: aaj ₹0. Faisla hamesha uska

00:40.488 --> 00:43.590
Website ban rahi hai — achaar brand ka design, catalogue, order flow

00:43.990 --> 00:48.036
Saheli khud website khol kar check karti hai — live ✓

00:48.436 --> 00:52.645
Sonali’s Achaar — ab poore India ke liye

00:53.045 --> 00:57.898
Customer order karta hai — koi account nahi chahiye

00:58.298 --> 01:01.313
Order #1001 — UPI seedha Sonali ke account mein

01:01.713 --> 01:10.505
Launch ke baad bhi saath: order, payment, agla kadam
